A foreigner jumped to his death from a condominium building in Sangkat Chroy Changva, Khan Chroy Changva
(Phnom Penh): A foreigner jumped to his death from a condominium building at dawn on August 24, 2023, located on National Road 6A, Sangkat Chroy Changva, Khan Chroy Changva, Phnom Penh, leaving a letter 3 words in the condo room.
Reports from the scene confirmed that they heard a loud crash near the condominium building and ran to see a foreigner lying dead, suspected to have jumped from above. Later, the specialized police force went down to the scene to examine the body and inspect the area of the scene.
According to the report, the foreigner actually committed suicide by jumping from the 24th floor, based on three letters written at the scene and apologizing to the owner. Well. Crowds from the scene expressed their deepest condolences on the foreigner's suicide and mourned the family of the deceased.
In the three letters, the victim wrote in English and translated, "I gave my cell phone to a friend. His (female) cell phone was broken. Let him keep this phone, he is a good person. My death has nothing to do with Cambodia. I used to be very happy, but now I feel nothing. My time has come, and I'm really sad and sorry for causing such a big thing to happen. ”
Currently, the authorities have contacted the embassy of the above foreigners to continue the procedure.
