National and international community praises and congratulates Dr. Chea Serey as the Governor-General of the National Bank of Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): Major international financial institutions and central banks, as well as many financial institutions, congratulated Dr. Chea Serey after she was appointed by the King as the Governor-General of the National Bank of Cambodia. Equivalent to Senior Minister.
Major international financial institutions and central banks, as well as many financial institutions, have expressed confidence that she is the most deserving figure to continue to further develop the Cambodian banking system.
In addition, the International Monetary Fund (IMF) highlighted in its message that it will look forward to continuing its "close cooperation" with the National Bank of Cambodia under the leadership of Dr. Chea Serey.
In addition to the above-mentioned international institutions, the central banks of many countries such as the Central Bank of Luxembourg, the Bank of Japan, the Bank of Korea, the Bank of Korea, the Monetary Authority of Singapore and the central banks of ASEAN countries also expressed their congratulations to Dr. Chea Serey. Based on her leadership, skills and clear vision for the future development of the Cambodian banking sector.
The Asian Development Bank (ADB) has expressed its pleasure to continue its close cooperation with the National Bank of Cambodia, while the ASEAN Plus Three Macroeconomic Research Office (AMRO) commended Dr. Chea Serey for many new initiatives. And stated that it is an invaluable achievement in contributing to Cambodia's economic growth and strengthening regional financial cooperation.
In addition, Ms. Chea Serey also received congratulations and wishes from the Ministries - Government, Diplomats and Foreign Offices in Cambodia, Banking and Finance Institutions, Associations in the financial sector and many institutions operating in Cambodia. .
