At the same time, the members of this Supreme Council are divided into two categories, the first category is the members of the founding party who participated in the election of the 7th legislature and registered as the first member of the Supreme Advisory Council. Within 2 weeks after the Royal Decree comes into force and 2. Ordinary members who request to join this mechanism later.
For the members of the founding political party, they will receive many privileges in advance, namely up to 3 delegates, in which the head of the delegation is equal to the senior minister, the deputy chairman is equal to the minister and the member is equal to the secretary of state and allows the chairman The delegation also has two assistants.
"This reorganization is to expand the scope of participation to ensure the vibrancy and environment for all political parties wishing to participate in providing advice and consultation to the Royal Government," he said.
