Take the position of the first minister! Heng Sour Appears with Workers on Veng Sreng Street
(Phnom Penh): On his first day as Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, Heng Sour appeared with workers at the Mengda Footwear factory on Veng Sreng Road to meet with workers and introduce some recommendations to management. Ministry officials and factory managers must visit the workers frequently and pay more attention.
The presence of the Minister at that time surprised the public and workers because they did not know in advance that he went to the workplace like this.
According to the content posted on the Facebook account on August 23, 2023, Minister Heng Sour stated, "The first day came to see the activities of shoe production and have lunch with workers who work at the Mengda Footwear factory. On Veng Sreng Street. At present, the factory has a total of more than 3,000 workers, including 160 pregnant workers and 43 people with disabilities.
Minister Heng Sour also had a meal with the workers at the Mengda Footwear factory, stating that the food at the factory was delicious and hygienic.
At the same time, the new Minister of Labor stressed that "Leaders and officials of the Ministry, including the manager of each factory must visit and eat with you often to taste the food, hygiene and find ways to improve. Or take it as a model to another place.
He added that there are more than 20 local unions at the factory. The relationship between the local union and the manager is able to negotiate and work together.
NEC revises and approves some documents related to the 2023 voter list review and registration
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Prach Chan, Chairman of the National Election Committee (NEC), on Wednesday morning, August 23, 2023, held a meeting to review and decide on some documents related to the examination of the list and Voter registration for the year 2023.
After reviewing and discussing each document in detail, the NEC meeting revised and agreed on those documents as follows:
1. Agree on the contents of the guidebook and supporting documents for the examination of the 2023 voter list and registration.
2: Agree on the content of short educational videos and radio, including: * 3 educational video spots * 3 gesture songs * 3 cartoon educational video spots * 3 educational radio spots * Announcement for broadcast Through a portable microphone 1 story.
3: Agree on the content of two long video articles, including:
4. Agree in principle on the use of 15 sample forms for the 2023 voter list review and registration.
5: Agree on the relevant documents to issue ID cards to national and international journalists, including:
* Notification on the submission and receipt of applications for registration as national and international journalists for the 2023 voter list and voter registration review * Application form for registration as a journalist * Your CV in Khmer Newspaper * English language profile of a journalist.
6: Approved 7 publications for publication, including: * NEC Newsletter Form * Book for Voter Registration * Notification on 2023 Voter Registration and Registration * Leaflet on Documents for use in 2023 voter registration * Stickers on the date of voter registration and voter registration * National and international journalists' cards * Press kits.
