Siem Reap to build light rail line from Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport to Siem Reap
(Siem Reap): Siem Reap will build a light rail line from Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport to Siem Reap, according to a consultation meeting between relevant institutions with the Chinese company China Metro to collect information and data for the study of light rail projects. From Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport to Siem Reap City of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport on August 23, 2023 at Siem Reap Provincial Hall.
He said that the company requested the authorities at all levels and relevant institutions to cooperate in collecting information and data, as the railway will pass through the Angkor area and may affect archeological sites or areas that the APSARA Authority has banned.
Mr. Pin Prak also instructed the relevant departments and municipalities to be ready to cooperate in providing information and data to companies that come to study and collect inputs for the inputs of the new light rail project from the International Airport. Siem Reap - Angkor to Siem Reap.
He added that in order to gather specific information and data, in-depth cooperation is required to study the project in order to avoid any serious impacts. This light train passes through the Angkor area. However, the project did not specify where to cross the Angkor area, making the talks fruitless.
