The crackdown was carried out on the orders of Brigadier General Neth Savoeun and Brigadier General Mak Chito, Deputy Commissioner General of the Anti-Drug Crime Plan, under the direct command of Lt. Gen. Kheng Sarath, Director of the Anti-Drug Department.
