Filing a bankruptcy is a common procedure, but the world's most indebted real estate developer, with more than $ 300 billion in debt, must file it as part of a legal debt restructuring process. Of America.
Many Chinese real estate developers have failed to meet their overseas debt obligations, leaving unfinished homes, declining sales and weakening investor confidence, hurting China's economy. According to Reuters.
