After the liberation, the gunmen boarded a Lexus 330 car of different colors, cigarettes with license plate Phnom Penh 2AA-4315, and escaped. A few hours later, the car in action was found and dumped. Police found five pistols and some other items. Currently, all relevant law enforcement forces are working together to search for criminals.
