Preah Vihear Provincial Authority launches a systematic land survey campaign for people in the hills of Preah Vihear City
(Preah Vihear): Mr. Ung Vuthy, Deputy Governor of Preah Vihear Province, on behalf of Mr. Kim Rithy, Provincial Governor, on the afternoon of August 18, 2023, paid a courtesy call and launched a systematic land survey campaign for the people in the hill area of Tasak village, Pal commune. Hall, Preah Vihear City, Preah Vihear Province.
Speaking to the people on that occasion, Mr. Ung Vuthy confirmed that this village was originally in the forest cover project of the Forestry Administration, but now the people have lived to enjoy many families, so the provincial administration requested the Royal Government And get permission to cut land from the state forest land project and measure the issuance of title deeds to people in the hills of this task.
At the same time, the Deputy Governor also expressed his congratulations to all the people who have received high consideration and attention from the Royal Government, which has decided to cut the land for the people now. At the request of Mr. Kim Rithy, Governor of Preah Vihear Province.
He also requested all residents to clearly define and lay the carpet and cooperate with the team to make it easier to measure. In addition, all citizens must understand and tolerate each other with adjacent borders so that there are no problems in measuring, that is, there is a problem with the border, the team can not measure for you.
Ms. Sim Chakrya, a representative of the people living in the hill area, the task of Pal Hal commune, expressed her great happiness that the Prime Minister decided to cut off the land from the control of the state and issue legal titles to the people.
The villagers would like to express their gratitude to Mr. Kim Rithy, Governor of Preah Vihear Province, for always thinking, paying attention, working hard and helping the people living here to get the right to use the land legally. .
In particular, I would like to thank Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, who has always considered the lives and livelihoods of the people, regardless of political affiliation, and would like to support the Cambodian People's Party, which has led the country to happiness. Peace is developed in all areas for the people.
