Victims of Lightning Strike on Roof in Rovieng District, Preah Vihear Province Receive Emergency Relief from Cambodian Red Cross
(Preah Vihear): Mr. Hor Bun Hour, Governor of Rovieng District, Preah Vihear Province and Honorary Chairman of the District Red Cross Sub-Branch, on the morning of August 18, 2023, led the District Working Group of the Cambodian Red Cross Sub-Branch, Reaksmey Commune Working Group to bring emergency relief of The Cambodian Red Cross handed over to a family living in Damnak Chen village, Reaksa commune, who was hit by lightning on the roof of their house, causing some damage.
On this occasion, Mr. Hor Bun Hour expressed his condolences to the families of the victims for the natural disaster, lightning caused damage to the roof, but nevertheless did not cause any family members to be injured in this incident.
Mr. Hor Bun Hour also conveyed the greetings from Senior Minister Meas Sophea, Honorary President of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch, Mr. Kim Rithy, Chairman of the Preah Vihear Provincial Branch of the Cambodian Red Cross, especially Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross. Always pay attention to the well-being and livelihood of the people, especially the people affected by various natural disasters.
In fact, today, after receiving the news that some of our people were affected by a natural disaster, lightning caused damage to the roof of the house, the Cambodian Red Cross immediately brought an emergency donation of 270,000 Riels, 1 rice, 1 bag. A box of soy sauce and some other materials.
He also advised people to be very careful in case of natural disasters and to keep the family clean by eating clean, drinking clean, living clean to prevent various diseases.
Xi Jinping chairs a meeting to study and manage flood and relief work and post-disaster reconstruction work
BEIJING, Aug. 17 (Xinhua) - The Standing Committee of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee convened on Aug. 17 to study and manage flood control and relief and post-disaster reconstruction work.
Xi Jinping, Secretary-General of the CPC Central Committee, chaired the meeting and delivered a keynote speech. The meeting pointed out that the period from July 16 to August 15 is an important period for flood prevention. Central enterprises and social forces have performed their duties bravely and sympathized with the people who achieved significant results in the stages of flood prevention and rescue.
