Professor Xia Huang said the launch of this state-of-the-art machine is another source of pride for the Khmer-Soviet Friendship Hospital as a way to make a more accurate diagnosis. And the hospital will not only stop equipping this equipment, but will continue to equip more modern equipment to treat people with high quality and efficiency, while the hospital also has many other equipment to provide services to citizens.
A senior health official added that the MRI machine was a joint venture between the private sector and the Khmer-Soviet Friendship Hospital. Equipping this equipment will give more confidence to the people, so people with health problems, please come to receive services, ensuring accurate diagnosis, effective treatment with a doctor who has the right skills and professional ethics.
At the same time, the director of the Khmer-Soviet Friendship Hospital also emphasized that "all our doctors are trained both locally and abroad, capable enough to provide various health services in the region." "On the other hand, our team of doctors is constantly evolving to keep up with new techniques to improve new skills and new diseases that arise, improving the quality of treatment for people more effectively."
At the same time, the director of the hospital and his staff are committed to continue to work together to provide health services to people more effectively, so that people do not find it difficult to find health services abroad, which increases the cost.
Please be informed that the MRI (MRI) machine to take pictures of the inside of our body from head to toe, especially on the diagnostic compression, as well as to monitor the treatment accurately, it is easy for doctors to evaluate all parts of the body. . Letters from readers: The non-recognition of His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet as the Prime Minister is a criticism of the law or an old lamp culture?
In fact, for observers of the election and political situation in Cambodia, which is not biased in the political message of the Cambodian People's Party and the announcement of Prime Minister Hun Sen, it is clear that the CPP has two candidates for Prime Minister for the second term election. 7. First, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and second, His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet. This message was confirmed in a public forum long before the election campaign.
In addition, all people in Cambodia see and hear the words "Support Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the candidacy of the Prime Minister and support His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet as the future Prime Minister" which is a clear political message from the Cambodian People's Party during the election campaign. CPP supporters, on the other hand, took these messages out of the campaign from the first day of the campaign until the end of the election campaign.
So far, the King has issued a message appointing His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet, and the new Council of Ministers will request the trust of the National Assembly on August 22, and in the evening of the 22nd, the new Cabinet will take office. .
Why so far there is still a political message that confuses the local people like this? And why do all parties refuse to recognize the victories and defeats that the Cambodian people draw?
The Cambodian People's Party (CPP) announced on December 24, 2021 that HE Dr. HUN Manet is the future Prime Ministerial candidate decided by the General Assembly of the Cambodian People's Party. On the other hand, in the election campaign, the Cambodian People's Party also announced two candidates for the Prime Minister, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet. In addition, HE Dr. HUN Manet also ran for the Phnom Penh Constituency.
According to the rules and procedures of forming a government, the winning party will elect a political figure to be nominated by the King to be the Prime Minister. Article 119- 2 states: "At the request of the party with the largest number of seats in the National Assembly, the King shall appoint an elite as Prime Minister to form the Government.
Through this event, we can understand that the Cambodian people are politically mature, as they have chosen to exercise their political rights by voting rather than protesting in the streets as in the past.
Therefore, continuing to criticize the illegality of the new Prime Minister, HE Dr. Hun Manet, it is just a political matter from the opposition in Cambodia. As a politician, we should put the national interest first, social harmony as a priority, no matter who comes to power, which party comes to power, which group comes to power, they are still Cambodians.
After more than 30 years of elections, Cambodians have suggested that unpopular politicians should change their approach to voting to show the strengths of their policies to the satisfaction of the people, rather than post-election lamps. This culture has been practiced for many mandates, which has never benefited society, only showing disgrace in society, sectarianism, and foreign contempt.
(Phnom Penh): Officials and processors of agricultural products encourage and encourage all artisans and traders who have been producing food products should turn to food production in accordance with safety standards to make their business grow and have a bigger market. Before and sustainable by gaining the trust of users.
