Chheang Thuch, a vegetable farmer in Prek Tonleab commune, said that every year her vegetable farm in the rainy season was flooded and could not harvest crops, but this year Prek Tonleab commune chief Ngy Sary The land was dammed to prevent the flooding of his vegetables, as well as other people, and made it easier for him, and the people harvested to this day.
