Phase 1: Students must register and write a brief description of their project from the official opening day until August 27, 2023.
Phase 3: Selected students from Phase 2 will receive a budget package and three weeks to prepare the sample material via video for the evaluation committee from September 8 to October 1. 2023.
Stage 5: Students who pass the fourth stage will receive additional training from experts and receive additional funding.
Stage 6: Public forum and announcement of the winners on October 23, 2023
Stage 7: The 3 winning teams can prepare to participate in the "Desire" event.
