Minister Khieu Kanharith: Strong journalists must know how to share information quickly and be united
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khieu Kanharith, Minister of Information, said that strong journalists now need to know how to share information quickly, spread it to all media and be united in order to be up-to-date.
In the dissemination and sharing of knowledge to the new civil servants in 2023, on the morning of August 16, 2023, Mr. Khieu Kanharith, Minister of Information, said that as a journalist must understand the law of the press because if journalists Understand and abide by this law will be protected in accordance with the law of the Constitution of Cambodia.
The Minister stated that as a journalist today, you need to know how to work together to find the real news, spread it quickly on all social media in order to become a strong journalist. Therefore, for the officials of the five Ministries of Information, the General Department under the Ministry of Information must be united, share experiences, share information with each other in order to jointly fight against false information to the people.
