Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara Praises and Appreciates Investment in Construction of Multipurpose Port and Logistics Center in Kampong Leng District (Kampong Chhnang): Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, praises and appreciates the investment. Construction of a multi-purpose port and logistics center in Phnom Tepi, Keng Ta Sok village, Kampong Hav commune, Kampong Leng district, Kampong Chhnang province.
The Deputy Prime Minister considered this investment as a contribution to improving Cambodia's transportation system, contributing to the national economy, helping people to have jobs and a better life.
On that occasion, Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara instructed the company management, staff, workers as well as the people to work together to make the investment successful and the port works as planned for the common good.
During the meeting with more than 300 staff and workers, the Deputy Prime Minister also donated 100,000 Riels to each of them.
Mr. Prak Vuthy, a representative of the above company, said that the area allowed by the Royal Government to invest is about 100 hectares, and the company's investment projects in this area include shipping ports, oil storage centers, tourist resorts and special economic zones. Industrial areas, markets, exchanges, warehouses for rent, warehousing and distribution of goods (national and international).
The construction of a multi-purpose port and logistics center in Kampong Leng district is an important waterway network policy for the Royal Government of Cambodia. Organizing a more diversified transport network, especially by water, is a big part of avoiding road damage and reducing transportation operating costs.
Currently, the company has completed the construction of many infrastructures, including pouring soil to improve the port yard to avoid flooding during the rainy season, pouring concrete roads from the national road to the port construction site, weighing station, construction of other administrative buildings. Now the port can also process shipping. The King orders the title of "Duke" to Som Tina
