(Central): A man, a veterinarian, took his mother's motorbike as collateral to pay off debts and fabricated a lie to complain to the police that he had been beaten by a thief with a gun and robbed the motorbike, but the truth is that this man He hit himself on the head with a stone and bled to lie to his mother and wife that he had been robbed and beaten on the head. The mother filed a complaint with the police to arrest the child in accordance with the law.
