Suspect's name is Ros Vathana, male, 27 years old, Khmer, Occupation: Veterinarian, Currently living in Borey Toul Sangke, Arey Ksat Village, Sangkat Arey Ksat, Arey Ksat City, Kandal Province. His mother's name is Om Sok.
