These are all things that Cambodian workers in South Korea have received the support of the government, which Samdech Techo Hun Sen has recommended since 2014 and is continuing to do so today.
These points make Cambodian workers and Cambodian families in South Korea turn to support almost 100% unconditionally to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet.
