"In the second half, we predict that nothing much will change due to the crisis that we have all heard about," he said. So I came up with ideas, and to see them flush it out, it's really fun. "If we compare the cost of our labor is equivalent to the A region of Vietnam, but our productivity is only 70% of the A region of Vietnam, so we must continue to train skills in this field to compete."
