Banteay Meanchey Provincial Police Arrests Suspect in Drug Suspension
(Banteay Meanchey): A suspect involved in drug offenses died of a heart attack while being taken to the temporary detention center of the Police Inspectorate of Mongkul Borei District, Banteay Meanchey Province on August 11, 2023.
Specialist forces under the coordination of the prosecutor's office went to Dang Run pagoda and found the suspect, Leang Lang, riding a motorbike in Wat Dai, holding a spare phone, escaped. He threw away the drugs but was not found by the police and was brought to the Mongkul Borei District Police Inspectorate for further questioning.
Upon arrival at the checkpoint, the suspect asked for food and asked to meet his aunt named Thea. At that time, the police gave him a package of rice, but he could not finish eating. The suspect took a shower and shouted that it was very hot, and the police suspected that the suspect could swallow the drug, swallowed it, then saw the suspect had a strange feeling, foaming at the mouth, it filled the toilet.
With suspicion, the force immediately reported to the prosecutor the condition of the suspect at 13:00, the prosecutor took to the hospital, tested the urine for drugs, and doctors immediately rescued until 17:15 The suspect died after two deaths, the force reported to the prosecutor that the suspect died, then the prosecutor advised to avoid charges.
