Wang Yi's visit after the Chinese government re-appointed him as foreign minister was marked by the Foreign Ministry as a visit to promote Cambodia-China relations and cooperation on the 65th anniversary of bilateral relations. In particular, the visit will further strengthen the diamond cooperation set out in Samdech Techo's visit to China in early 2023.
