Drugs and people's livelihoods are important tasks that Samdech Techo pointed out to the new Royal Government (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): The fight against drug trafficking and use and improving people's lives is a priority that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as the President of the Cambodian People's Party, pointed out that the new government should pay attention to the effective implementation.
The pointing point was made during the meeting and solidarity meal between the permanent members of the Cambodian People's Party and members of the Royal Government in the old mandate and more than 100 members of the new Royal Government in the evening on August 10, 2023 at the 7 Makara Headquarters. Cambodian People's Party.
In this important meeting at a time of historic change in the leadership of the CPP, Techo Hun Sen spoke about the election, the reshuffle of the Royal Government and the leadership for the new government.
Regarding the large-scale replacement of the leadership of the new Royal Government, Samdech Techo asked for the understanding of the senior officials of the Cambodian People's Party who were not appointed in the ranks of the new Royal Government. Samdech Techo stated that Samdech is the biggest sacrifice and is necessary for this exchange to ensure social stability and national development in the long run.
Samdech Techo continued that Samdech can stay in power for one or two terms, but now Samdech has decided not to stay in power anymore to give our youth the power to succeed Samdech.
In a speech for nearly an hour in front of senior leaders of the Cambodian People's Party, members of the old and new mandates of the Royal Government, Samdech Techo Prime Minister also expressed his desire to see the new Council of Ministers, the young people leave with energy. Brave, have a real will to serve the nation, serve the people and lead a strong economy.
Samdech Techo continued, "We will measure the departure of the new Cabinet, the young people in the first 100 days after the establishment of the Royal Government, the seventh legislature of the National Assembly, whether our youth What actions to take to solve all the challenges that are national and international issues.
Samdech Techo instructed the new Royal Government to focus on political stability, social security, economic issues and people's livelihood. Regarding the people's livelihood, Samdech Techo supported the continued implementation of social protection policies to alleviate the hardships of the people, which is a pressure arising from the global crisis.
Regarding the livelihood of the people, Samdech Techo instructed the Prime Minister and the Minister of the new government to continue to meet directly with the local people. Samdech Techo also instructed His Excellency Honorary Governor Dr. Hun Manet to visit the workers who Samdech promised to visit but have not met them yet.
The fight against drug trafficking is also another necessary task that Samdech Techo pointed out to the new government of the new mandate. Samdech Techo mentioned that the fight against drugs is a measure of the capacity of the Royal Government and if successful, will also receive the support of the people.
For this work to be successful for Samdech Techo, it is necessary to reform the institutions responsible for the drug problem, including the authorities to fight and crack down on drugs.
