(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khieu Kanharith, Minister of Information, emphasized that in the past, if someone was in charge of information, he was in power, but now, whoever distributes information quickly, he is in power. The Minister emphasized this during the ceremony of thanking and awarding medals to the leaders of the Ministry of Information on the morning of August 10, 2023 at the Ministry of Information.
Khieu Kanharith said that in the past, those who held the information could control and do anything, but nowadays there is so much information that the distribution of information will make everyone grasp and work in harmony and harmony. The Minister said that at present, officials of the Ministry of Information still lack the problem of knowledge sharing, sharing of information, especially the lack of internal communication.
He added that at the Ministry of Information, it is important for us to share our experiences, whether we are partisan or partisan.
The Minister claimed that at present, if all divisions know how to divide the work, it is good, but if they do not know how to divide, it is impossible to grasp the information because there is so much information. At the same time, the information technology system is running very fast, which is required now, the battle of this information war is very important, both the sharing of experience and the sharing of information.
