Hundreds of people lined up in front of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to appear before the court in the case of Tycoon Hee Kim Hong, the owner of the World Gold Company, defrauding them of money. However, it is not yet known exactly how many people cheated the tycoon.
Phnom Penh Municipal Police have arrested Tycoon Hee Kim Hong, the owner of the World Gold Company and a group of 14 bodyguards in connection with a case of fraud. The arrest took place on the afternoon of August 7, 2023 at the headquarters of the World Gold Company in Trapeang Thlan village, Sangkat Ponsaing, Khan Prek Pnov.
The arrest of the tycoon, the owner of the Golden Land Company, was made on a warrant issued by the Phnom Penh Municipal Court. He said the bodyguards had obstructed the court order and had also used violence against law enforcement.
According to Brigadier General San Sok Seiha, after the arrest of Tycoon Hee Kim Hong, he was taken to the Phnom Penh Municipal Police for questioning and further proceedings.
Sources at the scene also confirmed that during the operation, the police also clashed with the bodyguards of the owner of the World Gold Company until the police force to fire weapons to control the situation on the spot and arrested the bodyguards. Also.
Please be reminded that this tycoon Hee Kim Hong was also invited by the Kampot Provincial Police to come in for questioning regarding the complaint of the people who have invested in this company with a total amount of about 6 million dollars, but this tycoon did not He did not enter and even tried to evade responsibility until the authorities arrested him. Trainers and tour operators in Siem Reap receive additional training in digital and financial skills
