Mr. Khuong Sreng: We must serve them better to fit the trust and love of the people to the authorities
(Phnom Penh): The Governor of Phnom Penh, Mr. Khuong Sreng, urged the authorities in 14 districts and 105 communes to continue to provide better services to the people, that is, to be worthy of the people's trust in our authorities. .
Mr. Khuong Sreng's urging was made on the occasion that he and Mr. Mop Sarin, President of the Phnom Penh Capital Council, chaired the 51st Ordinary Meeting of the Phnom Penh Capital Council this morning, August 10, 2023. Phnom Penh Capital Hall.
Mr. Khuong Sreng said that the provision of services through the OWSO in the 14 districts as well as in the 105 Sangkats is good and has the support of the people. Therefore, he called on the authorities to continue their efforts to provide better services to the people, as the people now live in a civilized environment that requires our work to be civilized as soon as possible.
Mr. Khuong Sreng also stated that through the results of the 7th National Assembly election on Sunday, July 23, 2023, it shows that the people really love the leadership of the Royal Government. As well as our Phnom Penh authorities. So in response, we must serve them better to deserve the trust and love of the people for our authority.
In addition, Mr. Khuong Sreng stated that garbage is still an issue that we, the authorities, must continue to pay attention to without leaving garbage on the streets. Therefore, he urged the authorities of 14 districts and 105 communes to continue to educate people to respect the time when taking out the garbage. "We will soon impose fines on littering, but what needs to be done now is to educate them about littering," he said.
He said that the fruitful results in all areas that we achieved in July 2023 is really the result of active participation with the spirit of awakening the unity of government officials at all levels and the people of Phnom Penh. The attention of the Board of Governors of Phnom Penh. Through this achievement, especially the economic development has contributed to improving the lives of the people of Phnom Penh to be better.
