Samdech Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An said this while presiding over the inauguration ceremony of the Sunder Entrepreneurs Association in Cambodia and the inauguration ceremony of the second mandate director of the Fusan Chinese Entrepreneurs Association in Cambodia on the afternoon of August 9, 2012. 2023 at Building 36A, Street 242, Sangkat Boeung Prolit, Khan 7 Makara.
