According to the announcement of the Cambodian Duke Association, the forum will be attended by Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister, Secretary General of the Council for the Development of Cambodia, and the Commercial Attaché of Foreign Representations in Cambodia.
