(Takeo): Receiving principles from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, the General Secretariat of the National Authority for Combating Drugs and the Takeo Provincial Drug Control Committee this morning, August 8, 2023, co-organized the International Day for Combating Drugs. Anti-drug, June 26, 2023.
