On that occasion, he highlighted that this is the 51st time that the Department of Private Security Management has organized a training course for private security agents for private security agencies to provide services and non-services. In this refresher course, all participants will gain knowledge on important topics that we are all experiencing and facing on a daily basis in performing work such as:
* Roles and responsibilities of private security agencies * Target prevention methods * Road traffic laws * How to provide assistance and cooperation with law enforcement * Understanding the criminal code and criminal procedure code * Fire prevention measures and evacuation Fire and scene protection cooperation.
He sincerely hopes that all participants will pay attention to listen to Veal Khmin explain and apply this knowledge to fulfill their role in a positive way to effectively protect the private interests of the public and our society. The whole.
