(Phnom Penh): The Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, which has deployed more than 40,000 members to observe the 7th National Assembly Election on August 7, 2023, has issued a statement fully supporting the official results of The 7th National Assembly Election announced by the National Election Committee on August 5, 2023.
