According to the Kralanh District Authority, in the past week, some communes in the upper part have been affected by floods in Snuol and Krouchkor communes, affecting rain-fed rice crops. Rainfall of 313 hectares. Among them, 236 hectares of medium paddy, 77 hectares of heavy paddy, 315 families were affected and a school yard was flooded.
