Mr. Ung Kimleang continued that in order to respond in a timely manner in accordance with the high-level instructions of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, in order for the provincial and district authorities to conduct a basic assessment of the specific impact on the work. Grow crops and infrastructure in the local area, along with the actual needs of the people to help intervene to restore quickly and timely.
