The following is the full text of Prince Sar Kheng:
"Message to my dear compatriots! After the general election for the 7th mandate, and especially after Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen issued a special message after cracking down on the King, the most revered group of politicians and analysts Opposition parties have repeatedly called for a "significant internal split" within the CPP.
In this regard, as the Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party, I would like to inform all Cambodians, especially the overwhelming majority of Cambodians who have supported the CPP:
The CPP's internal divisive tactics have been around for a long time, some of which have not yet been born, some of which have been disbanded, and some of them are still doing stupid politics. In contrast, the CPP maintains a strong internal unity and the overwhelming support of the people to continue to lead the country in peace and development.
In this regard, I will continue to support and support the government of the seventh mandate, with His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet as the Prime Minister, to fulfill its duties successfully according to the principles decided by the CPP Congress. "I wish all my compatriots happiness and prosperity under the shadow of peace and development."
