Since the NEC announced the provisional results on August 1, 2023 at seven o'clock and zero in the morning, so the 72-hour period is limited to seven o'clock and zero in the morning on August 4, 2023. Neither the Constitutional Council nor the NEC has received any official complaints from political parties against the provisional results of this election.
