The following is the announcement of Kampong Thom Provincial Administration: A fire broke out in an apartment building in Poipet City, injuring 4 foreigners
(Banteay Meanchey): An apartment building named "V9" located in Kbal Spean 1 Village, Sangkat O'Chrov, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province, caught fire on the evening of August 3, 2023, causing 4 Indonesians to suffer. Injuries.
In this incident, Mr. Ngor Meng Chruon, Deputy Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province and Mr. Keat Hul, Governor of Poipet City led the police to intervene to help put out the fire by using two vehicles, nearly 20 fire hoses.
According to the police, the V9 brand building that foreigners rented as a 10-storey apartment building caught fire from room 901 on the 8th floor, causing the Indonesian to suffocate and jump from the building with minor injuries. Four people, one of them jumped from the ninth floor, breaking his arm and face.
According to authorities, the cause of the fire was caused by an Indonesian man who was smoking and throwing cigarette butts on the mattress, causing the fire to startle.
