(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts has released a video announcing the talent of Chapey Dang Veng to participate in the National Chapey Dang Veng Festival 2023, which will be held from October 2-4, 2023 at the Department Theater. Performing Arts.
The nationwide Chapey Dang Veng Festival 2023 was held in the cause of preserving, protecting and promoting the Chapey Dang Veng art form to grow even more. The Ministry of Culture would like to ask those who are talented in the field of Chapey Dang Veng to apply for the exam before August 25, 2023.
According to the SOC, the field of culture and fine arts, Chapey Dang Veng, is a traditional art in Cambodian society. Chapey has penetrated deeply into the traditional life and beliefs of the Cambodian people by observing them playing in important traditional ceremonies such as wedding ceremonies, weddings, shaving ceremonies, baptisms and Kathin ceremonies.
Chapey Dang Veng was inscribed on the UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity list on November 30, 2016.
