(Phnom Penh): His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, has issued a Royal Decree appointing Major General Moeng Ponlok as Director General of the General Department of Logistics and Finance, Ministry of National Defense. This is according to the Royal Decree received by Fresh News on the morning of August 3, 2023.
