The following is the Royal Decree of the King: Important remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of the inauguration of the Third Ring Road
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a two-hour talk, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that starting from the needs of the people, it is necessary to build a third ring road.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Chinese government for financing the construction of the Third Ring Road.
China declares its unwavering support for Cambodia's development to ensure national sovereignty and oppose interference in Cambodia's internal affairs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the third ring road is the most expensive road. More than 52 kilometers long, construction cost more than 273 million dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the money for the construction of the third ring road is worthy of quality.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that by 2026, Techo International Airport will be operational.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that today, Samdech delivered a message in the last public forum as the Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked more than 84% of the people who went to the polls on July 23.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the election in Cambodia has two characteristics. The first is a contest for seats in the National Assembly, and the other is a contest between pro-democracy activists calling for people to go to the polls, and the other is to destroy democracy by preventing people from going to the polls and marking ballots.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the election in 2023 is a real competition between the supporters of democracy by calling the people to vote and the destroyers of democracy to prevent people from going to the polls.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen declares that democracy in Cambodia has won by conducting regular elections
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the destruction of democracy in Cambodia has already been proven.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the people's election now is to vote for peace and development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that his resignation as Prime Minister now is to ensure long-term peace and development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are four reasons that led to Samdech resigning as Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen questioned which leaders in the history of Cambodia volunteered to resign?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that placing a position during one's lifetime is better than transferring one's position at the end of one's life. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the current transfer of Samdech's position is based on the example of His Majesty the King.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that assigning roles to youth groups now is a good time to ensure peace and development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the formation of the new Royal Government has two scenarios. The first is for the old to lead one to two years and the second scenario is for the new to lead from the beginning of the mandate. Finally, decide on the second scenario.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Dr. Hun Manet took office as Prime Minister up to 14 years older than Samdech. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in China, the maximum age limit for government officials is 67 years, and in Vietnam it is 65 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the new government has more than half a doctorate degree.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the personal secretaries of the three Samdech who went up to the Deputy Prime Minister and Senior Minister were: Samdech Vibol Panha Sok An, Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth and Senior Minister Cham Prasidh.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that starting from the experience of Samdech to become the Prime Minister without having the role of party president, Samdech left the possibility for the new Prime Minister to manage the work. But it is not different from the party's policy.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked for supporting Dr. Hun Manet as Prime Minister for the new term.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if Mr. Hun Manet endangered his life, he would return to the Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this is to ensure the well-being of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that if the election in this mandate receives less than 70% of the support, Samdech will continue to hold the position of Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech's habit was never to order the Minister to do this or that, but to give independence to all decisions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that HE Neth Sara Voeun and HE Sun Chanthol will soon become Deputy Prime Ministers, while the National Police Commissioner General will change.
