While the east gate of the East Mebon Temple is at risk of the tower, the technical team of the Department of Temple Preservation and Archeology of the APSARA Authority has identified the site to identify the risk and strengthen the foundations. In order to help balance. So far, the rescue and strengthening of the north gate of the eastern Mebon temple has reached 50%.
Please note that the project to repair the north gate of the East Mebon Temple has also received the opinion of the ICC-Angkor Committee.
