(Paris): Cambodia respects the freedom of expression of the electorate, and the ballots for the 7th National Assembly election on July 23, 2023 were clean. This was confirmed by Luca SCHIO, President of the International Coalition of Electoral Observers (IAEO), headquartered in Paris.
Luca SCHIO confirmed in an official video that, as IAEO has already stated in the announcement, on election day, we observe a high level of public participation, calm and sometimes in a fun atmosphere. Enjoy. The number of voters is high, especially among young people, which is a testament to the strength of the people.
"In conclusion, we can conclude that Cambodia respects the law on party representation and the electoral process, as well as the freedom of expression of voters, where the ballots are clean and transparent," he said.
