Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng Inaugurates Drug Addiction Treatment and Rehabilitation Center in Rattanak Mondul District, Battambang Province
(Battambang): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, presided over the inauguration ceremony of the Drug Addiction Treatment and Rehabilitation Center in Phnom Penh on the morning of August 2, 2023. In Sdao village, Sdao commune, Rattanak Mondul district, Battambang province.
The ceremony was also attended by General Ke Kim Yan, Deputy Prime Minister and Chairman of the National Authority for Combating Drugs, as well as members of the National Assembly and Senate, Secretary of State, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Interior, Chairman of the Provincial Council, Governor of Battambang. , Armed forces of all kinds, heads of departments around the province, youth, students and many more people.
On that occasion, Mr. Sok Lou said that the drug treatment and rehabilitation center for drug addicts Ke Sinuon, which was inaugurated now, is another new achievement of the province, which is a construction initiative by Dr. Ke Sinuon is a member of Battambang Provincial Council and has the support of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng.
The provincial governor added that the 15-hectare drug rehabilitation center will be built from May 20, 2022 to December 12, 2022 for six months. . The center has two dormitories, 23 separate rooms that can accommodate 400 to 500 drug addicts.
On that occasion, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng said that on behalf of the Royal Government of Cambodia, I would like to express my gratitude and appreciation for all the efforts of the provincial, district and commune administrations as well as all government officials in Battambang province. Together with the people in the development of maintaining security, stability, as well as the economic development and livelihood of the people, which makes Battambang more prosperous.
Samdech Krala Hom also continued that the Royal Government's working group in Rattanak Mondul district, Battambang province also tried to solve problems for the people. At the same time, Samdech Krala Hom considered that these are also important achievements that have contributed to the Royal Government of Cambodia in solving challenges for the people.
Regarding the rehabilitation of drug addicts, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng also emphasized that the political program of the Royal Government of Cambodia has focused on the fight against drugs, and in the last five years, the authorities have cracked down and confiscated Large quantities of drugs and hundreds of tons of drugs today are a combination of drugs, meaning "they combine various chemicals to produce drugs."
At the same time, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng expressed his hope and belief that the Center for the Treatment and Rehabilitation of Drug Addicts will be successful in its mission and contribute to the rehabilitation of drug addicts.
