Two water well diggers die while rehabilitating wells in Sithor Kandal district, Prey Veng province
(Prey Veng): Two well diggers died in a well while restoring and installing a drain and without oxygen. This case happened at 18:00 on August 1, 2023 in the field west of Ska Kdei village, 1700 meters away, in Ska Kdei village, Phnov II commune, Sithor Kandal district, Prey Veng province.
Sithor Kandal District Police Inspector said that the two victims were:
The district police chief said that prior to the incident, the well owner had hired the two victims to restore the well and install additional drainage. Water.
He added that while the two victims went down into the well and disappeared until 9:00 pm the same day, the family went to look for them and found them dead in the well.
The inspector continued that in this case, according to the competent experts, it was concluded that it was caused by the two victims who went down to the well, which was deep and there was no oxygen to cause such deaths.
The body has now been handed over to the family for a traditional ceremony.
