Two suspects arrested after seizing a bag in Bavet commune, Bavet city
(Svay Rieng): While patrolling the local security guards, the Bavet Administrative Police Force on the night of August 1, 2023 arrested two suspects and brought them in for questioning in connection with the case of seizing the bags of two Vietnamese nationals.
