Kantha Bopha Building "Sihamoni Monineath" is a new achievement of Kantha Bopha Hospital, which is equipped with modern medical equipment and plays an important role in saving the lives of children with serious illnesses. In the four years of the hospital, more than 2,000 Cambodian children have been rescued from the plague.
On the morning of August 1, 2023, representatives of the Ministry of Health, representatives of the Kantha Bopha Foundation in Switzerland and Cambodia, the management of Kantha Bopha Hospital, a group of doctors, including parents and children who have been treated from this building, held a gathering to celebrate. Congratulations on the 4th anniversary of the opening of the Kantha Bopha "Sihamoni Monineath" building.
Dr. Kisanti, Director of Kantha Bopha Hospital of Cambodia, stated that Kantha Bopha "Sihamoni Monineath" has played an important role in rescuing children with serious diseases such as heart problems, bone marrow surgery, neurology and pediatric emergency. And infants.
The presence of Kantha Bopha "Sihamoni Monineath" has contributed significantly to reducing the mortality rate of children with serious illnesses, or in other words, Kantha Bopha has played an important role in taking the lives of Cambodian children from the gates of death.
Ms. Ai Sa, a resident of Stung Trang district, Kampong Cham province, was also invited to attend this morning's ceremony. In 2022, Aysad's daughter developed severe lung disease. She recalled that at that time she had no hope that her daughter could live because her condition was too serious.
Ms. Aisad recalled that her daughter was hospitalized in Kantha Bopha "Sihamoni Monineath" for 23 days under the highest level of care and treatment. By now, Aisad's daughter, who is over 10 years old, is in good health and can go to school without any health problems.
Ms. Ay Sa also mentioned that Kantha Bopha Hospital was the angel who saved her daughter's life, and without this hospital, her daughter might not have survived to this day. She considered the presence of Kantha Bopha Hospital as an important hospital for Cambodian children.
