The Indonesian Embassy in Phnom Penh will host the 14th Indonesia Trade and Tourism Fair from 4 to 6 August 2023
ITTP is more than just product exhibitions and tourism promotion events. ITTP is also a joint outreach event held annually by the Embassy since 2006 to promote Indonesia in areas such as trade, tourism, study opportunities, arts, culture and cooking.
Under the theme "Strengthening Relationships", ITTP 2023 aims to promote cooperation not only between governments and governments, but also between peoples and peoples, to promote bilateral cooperation in various fields and to make Indonesia Closer to the Cambodian people.
ITTP offers a wide range of programs ranging from exhibitions and sales of Indonesian products, tourism promotion, business matching as well as many cultural events such as cooking and singing competitions, karaoke, fashion shows, music and dance performances, games and quizzes. Rewards questions and so on.
ITTP 2023 will be attended by 17 Indonesian companies (including 2 state-owned enterprises), 15 distributors of Indonesian products in Cambodia, 2 well-known universities in Indonesia, as well as representatives from the Ministry of Tourism and Innovation Economy of Indonesia and the government. West Sumatra.
