Ms. Khieu Sina Chea Chanto stated that everyone needs peace, both physically and mentally, so finding peace for each person is difficult if there is no confidence and peace in The mind does not know the true value of peace, nor can it attain peace.
Through this meritorious deed, she would like to dedicate a part to the grandparents, parents and relatives of the seven generations, and dedicate another part to the spirit of the patriotic warriors of all generations who sacrificed their lives. For the cause of the nation, the motherland and the Cambodian people who lost their lives in the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
