Please listen to Dr. Yong Pov's remarks below: The Governor of Kampong Cham Province encourages professional officials, authorities and people to plant trees together to develop the forestry sector in all areas in the province
(Kampong Cham): The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, inspired the Forestry Administration officials, local authorities and people to love, care and plant one tree per family to develop the forestry sector in all areas in Kampong Cham province. .
The provincial governor said so on the morning of July 31, 2023, during the July 9 Tree Day ceremony held at Anlong Ok Secondary School in Anlong Ok village, Sokong commune, Kang Meas district.
The governor said that forests are important natural resources to maintain the balance of the environment, such as maintaining water source regulation, protecting slopes, preventing erosion, attracting rain, purifying the air, providing non-timber forest products for use, preserving biodiversity and contributing to Develop national economy, eco-tourism, ecology, culture and a peaceful haven for all kinds of animals that live on our planet.
However, deforestation will be a problem that causes soil degradation and natural disasters such as hurricanes, typhoons, floods and droughts.
The provincial governor stated that the activities of clearing and encroaching on the forest land, flooded forest, which is a fish sanctuary for planting agricultural crops or for other purposes without long consideration and not following the technical rules are the main reasons. To destroy natural resources, lose some useful forest functions as mentioned above.
