(Mr. Tbong Khmum): Mr. Kittisetha Dr. Cheam Yeap, First Vice President of the National Assembly and Ms. Hak Chou Cheam Yeap and Lt. Gen. Meng Vandy and Ms. Chhorn Sakhorn Meng Vandy, together with relatives and friends, presented candles on the morning of July 31, 2023. Rain, food and suffixes for monks waiting for rain at 25 pagodas in 7 cities in Tbong Khmum province.
On that auspicious occasion, Dr. Cheam Chansophoan, Governor of Tbong Khmum Province, and Ms. Meng Van Danin, Mr. Kim Santepheap, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Justice, and Mrs. Tbong Khmum Provincial Administration were present.
Preah Vossa candles that are offered to all 25 pagodas: In each pagoda, 1 pair of Preah Vossa candles, 1 box of pure water, 5 boxes of pure water, 4 boxes of noodles, 3 boxes of orange juice, 100 kg of rice, 5 kg of salt, 5 kg of bean curd, 10 kg of sugar 3 kg of Bakas drink, 1 box of fish, 1 box of condensed milk, 1 box of cooking oil, 2 bags of soy sauce, 2 bags of fish sauce, 1 box of cheese, 1 basket and suffix, as well as handing out sarongs and budget to the grandparents.
For the offering of Vesa candles as well as food and suffixes to the monks on this occasion to burn, offer sacrifices to God and study the Dharma of the Dharma of our Master Samma.
Please be informed that the rainy season lasts for 3 months to contribute to the support of the monks who are still in the pagoda to learn various disciplines during the 3 months of this rainy season.
The Vesa festival is an important festival in Buddhism, an important time for monks and nuns to learn the Dharma and discipline consistently according to the Buddha's teachings.
For each pagoda during the three months of the rainy season, it is not allowed to travel far and wide during the day and night, unless there are important duties such as parents who are seriously ill or going to perform dharma, etc., determined to return. Within 7 days.
People who believe in Buddhism often celebrate the festival by bringing rice, drinks and other items to the monks as much as possible.
