(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP), sent a message of thanks to Xi Jinping, Secretary-General of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China (CPC), for sending a message from Beijing to congratulate the victory again. Of the Cambodian People's Party in the election of the 7th legislature of the National Assembly on July 23, 2023.
