(Phnom Penh): A fire broke out at a Golden Pearl jewelry store, completely destroying the third floor room and not spreading to neighbors.
Colonel Prohm Yorn, Director of the Fire Prevention and Rescue Police Office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, confirmed that after receiving information from residents to report to professional officers, he immediately ordered all fire trucks to evacuate. Firefighters came out to intervene as well.
Colonel Prohm Yorn said that in the above operation, the specialized force immediately intervened and sprayed water, in which the specialized police force sprayed water to prevent the flames from spreading further.
