Incitement group to cross another ballot in Takeo province to confess in front of the authorities
(Takeo): Another group of opposition party activists who incited people to cross the ballot box in Takeo province confessed in front of the authorities on July 26, 2023.
Din Sothearith, a 42-year-old blacksmith from Kampong Chrey village, Smaong commune, Traing district, Takeo province, confessed to his wrongdoing by posting a message on Facebook before the election day to incite people to vote. On election day, it posted a message that it had crossed out the ballots and did not vote for any political party.
