Meanwhile, the Stall Rental Revenue Collection Commission will start collecting money from traders from July 24, 2023 to October 24, 2023, every working hour at the office of Deum Kor Market Commission through account number 0010001494867. Canadia Bank Plc. Will exchange the old stall card for a new one.
In the above case, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration considers that the traders have given up their right to occupy their booths that are currently doing business.
