Although the exact number of votes is not yet known, Mr. Tep Nytha said that the election is counting valid ballots, which are the votes of the people, so the invalid ballots do not affect No vote.
The Secretary-General of the NEC stated, "We have not yet received the exact number of invalid ballots, but we do know that the results of the ballots are valid." And the valid ballot is the vote of the people, so the valid is the result. "The invalid ballots do not affect the election results."
Prior to the election, a handful of foreign-based extremist politicians used all means to obstruct the election process and try to incite voters to cast their ballots. .
In the 7th National Assembly Election 2023, which runs from 7 am to close at 3 pm on July 23, 2023, a handful of people posted invalid ballots. In the telegram group and on the social network Facebook. However, after seeing this phenomenon, the police immediately launched an urgent search and reached the target.
After investigating the case of election incitement organized by Sam Rainsy prisoner, now the competent authorities have found the target of inciting election destruction with Sam Rainsy prisoner through the telegram group "Sabai Sabay" has increased to 40 people. They face legal penalties and fines.
On the evening of July 23, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen warned the people about their illegal activities and instructed them to come out and confess their guilt.
Immediately after the announcement of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Mr. Chhay Rath, a former provisional working group of the Sihanoukville Candlelight Party and Executive Vice President of the Sihanoukville Candlelight Party, who crossed the ballot, confessed and apologized to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, because of his ignorance, believes in the incitement of three generations of traitor Sam Rainsy.
