(Phnom Penh): The Committee for ASEAN Youth Cooperation and the Asian Youth Council, after observing the election of the 7th National Assembly of Cambodia tonight, issued a joint statement that this election is transparent, peaceful, free and fair.
"Our delegation considers the ongoing 2023 general election to be transparent, peaceful, free and fair," the statement said.
