(Phnom Penh): Dr. Soeng Samnang, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, Chairman of the Kampong Leng District Local Assistance Team, and her and her family on Sunday morning, July 23, 2023, went to the National Assembly election. The 7th legislature is already at Office No. 1682, Sopheak Mongkul Primary School, Sangkat Kakab, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
