(Banteay Meanchey): Poipet City Gendarmerie Local Force led by Brigadier General Nuon Ninaro, Municipal Gendarmerie Local Commander, arrested a suspect in two motorcycle theft cases in Poipet City based on the complaint of the victim, Chan Sok Chan Male, 48 years old, resides in Kbal Spean 2 Village, Sangkat Poipet, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province.
After being arrested and questioned, the suspect confessed that he had actually stolen two motorcycles. After stealing a motorcycle to pawn money to gamble and buy drugs to use, but not yet pawned, he was arrested by the military police.
The suspect also admitted that he had been imprisoned three times in the past, involving two thefts and one drug case. Based on the confession and the actual evidence, the Poipet Municipal Gendarmerie Force builds a case and sends the suspect to the Provincial Gendarmerie Command to proceed with the procedure.
