(Kampong Cham): On the morning of July 21, 2023, the candidate for the National Assembly of Kampong Cham province, Mr. Pan Sosak, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Working Group for Prey Chhor and Batheay Districts, led the CPP members. More than 3,000 Cambodians from Prey Chhor district marched in the fourth campaign of the 2023 National Assembly election in 2023 in Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province.
The fourth march started from the CPP headquarters in Prey Chhor district to local communes in Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province to disseminate the party's policies and seek the support of the people for the election. The 7th legislature of the National Assembly in 2023, which will take place on Sunday, July 23, 2023.
On that occasion, the candidate of the National Assembly brought a message from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, both of which always consider the well-being of all people. And always advise the leaders of the Cambodian People's Party at all levels to pay attention to serve the interests of the people well and honestly.
* First, to protect the constitutional monarchy through a liberal, multi-party democratic political system in a sustainable manner, as well as to strengthen and expand multi-party liberal democracy to lay a solid foundation in the society while strengthening the rule of law. With the promotion of respect for human rights.
* Second: Strengthen national unity and commit to prevent and eliminate all forms of politics and extremist activities caused by any individual or group, individual or political organization or any hostile environment that seeks to incite national division, create social chaos and destroy Peace creates political instability in Cambodia in the form of rebellion, which is completely contrary to the principles of democracy and violates the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
* Fourth: Continue to pursue an independent foreign policy based on the law to protect sovereignty and territorial integrity against all forms of external interference, build better friendship and cooperation between the Kingdom of Cambodia with all countries in the world and international organizations. And actively contribute to the cause of peace, stability, security, cooperation and prosperity in the region and the world.
To ensure the protection and promotion of the interests of the people, the CPP will promote the effective implementation of six priority policies and six priority policy programs in the political program of the Royal Government of the 7th legislature of the National Assembly. The working group of the Cambodian People's Party has been promoting in the campaign from July 1, 2023 until now.
Please note that the political program of the Cambodian People's Party 2023-2028 is a continuation of the political program 2018-2023 and respond to the evolution of the actual situation in the country and abroad.
