She stated that she supported and always voted for the Cambodian People's Party in all mandates, because she received a message from her husband, Mr. Sos Slaiman, also known as Sled, who knew Samdech Techo well and used to grab Lobster with Samdech Techo when he was a child told his children to support Samdech Techo and his family until the day he died.
