Royal Government: The success of the ASEAN Summit shows the great leadership ability of Samdech Techo Hun Sen (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the 40th and 41st ASEAN Summits and The relevant summits, held directly from November 10 to 13, 2022, went smoothly, with security, safety, cooperation and historic achievements.
The hosting of this regional conference has been highly praised and supported by leaders around the world. The brilliant success of leading the ASEAN Summit and related summits has created a great deal of national honor, national pride and national prestige for the nation and the people of Cambodia as a whole.
The success of the ASEAN Summit is seen as a demonstration of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's great leadership ability.
According to Dr. Sok Touch, President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, Cambodia, as the chair of ASEAN, has achieved three points, including:
* First: Invite superpowers that have never attended a meeting with ASEAN, while in the past, those superpowers only sent assistants or advisers to attend the meeting, but vice versa, when Cambodia becomes the chair of ASEAN, invites the president, superpower or representative of the president or director. The minister came to the meeting in Cambodia and saw the face of Cambodia that Cambodia is not what they have been described.
* Second, a small country but maintains good security, which is not a problem during the time that Cambodia is the chair of ASEAN, and there is no problem, even if Kovid 19 strikes money, Cambodia can take ownership of This is the case.
* And thirdly, when Samdech Techo Hun Sen traveled to Europe as the chair of ASEAN and as the Prime Minister of Cambodia, the French President received Samdech Techo Hun Sen face to face for the benefit of ASEAN.
Cambodia became a member of ASEAN in April 1999 and has hosted two ASEAN Summits in 2002 and 2012. The hosting of the 2022 ASEAN Summit is also seen by the Cambodian people as bringing more national honor and prestige.
Mr. Nuon Phearum, a former student of the Royal University of Law and Economics, said that as a citizen as well as the general public, he was very proud and happy to host the meeting. This ASEAN summit because there are superpowers involved.
He added that this meeting is really important for Cambodia and ASEAN countries, including:
* 1: Promote National Honor and Prestige: As the rotating chair of ASEAN, it is possible to hold summits with the participation of major powers, especially the United States, which demonstrates harmony, complete peace, security and stability. Order, which is the full confidence of the member countries of the meeting.
* 2: Expand markets and increase economic opportunities: Of course, the ASEAN Summit will have delegations from many countries, at the same time, investors will look for growth, especially investment opportunities in Cambodia through This meeting or through the media speaks separately.
* 3: In addition, this meeting is also a method of attracting tourists to visit in Cambodia, in this meeting will be the visit of the member countries of the meeting to visit Angkor, which is the main element in Promoting to the world from tourist destinations in Cambodia as well.
"Overall, this ASEAN Summit has brought a lot of benefits to Cambodia and its member countries." This is according to Mr. Nuon Phearum.
At the same time, Mr. Bunthon Sokha Narith, an intern at the Royal School of Administration, also expressed his pride that he was born before Cambodia hosted three ASEAN Summits. He mentioned the merits of peace that led to Cambodia being the venue for such a grand event.
Mr. Bunthon Sokhanarith continued, "If I do not forget, I have heard the senior leaders of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Cambodia that these things are Cambodia has started to think carefully and have already studied. "In-depth, prepared before Cambodia took over the rotating chairmanship of ASEAN in 2022, while the world today is full of problems in the region and the world."
Meanwhile, Kong Sothearith, an artist, said that he was pleased that the Kingdom of Cambodia, as the rotating chair of ASEAN, would host the 40th and 41st ASEAN Summits.
The artists who will be performing at the ASEAN event added that, of course, the ASEAN Summit has brought many benefits to the community as a whole, especially in the context of Kovid-19, which has made each nation see and understand better. Working together to address challenges, considering resilience, strengthening quality, security, promoting economic growth, unity, harmony, prosperity, community, society, culture and common development towards achieving the common goals of ASEAN.
"As one of the artists who will be performing at this amazing event, which is 10 years before the turn, I am very happy and honored to have the opportunity to sing for the leaders of Countries. This is according to Mr. Kong Sothearith.
For Mr. Hun Many, President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, through Facebook, expressed 5 deep meanings as Cambodia is hosting the 40th and 41st ASEAN Summits and related summits from 10 to 13 November 2022.
The content attached to the image of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and ASEAN leaders to meet His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia on November 10, 2022, Mr. Hun Many wrote that this is not just an image, but It also has a deep meaning that shows:
* First, Cambodia has complete peace, which allows the country to be able to welcome the presence of the world's top leaders and the region, as well as the heads of major international institutions and organizations.
* Second, Cambodia has sufficient capacity to organize and lead summits, such as the ASEAN Summit and related meetings, which reflects the potential of leading human resources with a potential and favorable environment.
* Third: Cambodia has the same rights and powers as other countries in the world, including the right to initiate a vision, establish a mechanism for resolving regional and global issues.
* Fourth, Cambodia has transformed from a country once plagued by the ashes of war and chronic internal conflict, famine, human rights abuses, to a country that is developed in all areas, respects human rights, is democratic and Real rule of law
Fifth, Cambodia is on the right path under the wise and talented leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia. In this sense, we must all work together to maintain peace and continue to promote this prosperity for the sake of our nation and motherland.
The 40th and 41st ASEAN Summits and related ASEAN Summits have approved and noted a long list of about 100 documents as a guide for ASEAN activities and cooperation in the coming years.
For political science experts, these meetings are essentially successful in both content and image.
Dr. Yang Pov, a political science teacher, said that the 40th and 41st ASEAN Summits and related ASEAN summits were taking place at a time when the world was heating up politically, in terms of public health and ASEAN. In short, it is heating up as well as regional and global issues.
Dr. Yang Pov said that Cambodia has become a forum for global political dialogue, both political, economic and diplomatic, explaining that Cambodia used to be a country that depends on foreigners to help negotiate, find peace, help solve political problems, etc., but then Cambodia is A meeting place for top leaders to discuss the world's major issues.
"For example, Joe Biden met with leaders," he said. Giving the Ukrainian foreign minister the opportunity to raise the issue of war and the resolution and other informal dialogues of world and regional leaders. "Phnom Penh is remembered as a meeting place for top leaders on regional and global crises."
According to Dr. Yang Pov, another success is that Cambodia, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has great potential, with no world leader leaving the meeting, which shows that Cambodia has the ability to coordinate and organize. This also shows that Cambodia really has complete peace, which gives faith to the great power, daring to come without fear, as well as the ability to manage the success of Kovid 19 and protocol.
