Once again, I would like to call on all our compatriots everywhere to go to the polls on Sunday, July 23, 2023, because it is the only opportunity every five years to maintain peace and stability. And promote the development of the national society in all fields. Dr. Osman Hassan pays a courtesy call and discusses with Deputy Secretary General of the Organization of Islamic Cooperation
