He added that the OIC has always supported Cambodia as a member of the OIC Observer, and that 55 countries also supported Cambodia, while only two countries objected due to their political issues. Therefore, the OIC will make every effort to assist Cambodia in re-applying for observer membership at the next session and to coordinate with other relevant members regarding the Cambodian case.
