Breaking records, while agricultural exports have been recovering to pre-war levels. Food products are not subject to direct sanctions, but sanctions on Russian banks, coupled with the decision of major international companies such as John Deere to withdraw from the Russian market, have hurt Russian farmers because they do not. Can find accessories or seeds for planting.
