In order to provide additional warmth to the delegates of the SEA Games and the ASEAN Para Games, the first historic event in Cambodia to be successful, the host of Cambodia does not require all Southeast Asian delegates to pay for food and lodging, which costs $ 50 per day. Not at all. All ASEAN sports delegates and athletes receive free meals and accommodation, an unprecedented event in the history of the SEA Games.
