This is a major achievement of the Royal Government of Cambodia in the sixth mandate, led by the Cambodian People's Party, with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as party president and Prime Minister of Cambodia. Samdech Techo Hun Sen has dedicated this work to all generations of Cambodian ancestors.
