In addition to beef noodles, Orang Ov has many other products, such as Ansam, palm leaves, cucumbers, mats and so on. Mr. Sophalleth plans to promote the reputation of local products in Orang Ov to be famous as an economy for the people of Orang Ov.
Mr. Sophalleth also intends to promote catfish farming in Orang Ov district, processing food into an identity for Orang Ov district.
