Phnom Penh Capital Administration Announces Temporary Avoidance of All Types of Vehicles During Tomorrow's Election Campaign
(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration has announced the temporary avoidance of all types of vehicles during the election campaign for the 7th National Assembly Election 2023 on July 20, 2023 tomorrow.
According to the announcement received by Fresh News during the 7th National Assembly Election Campaign 2023 on July 20, 2023, 1 of the 18 parties has applied to the organizing committee. Phnom Penh Capital Election to gather members and campaign for election in Phnom Penh along the following routes:
At 14:00, the procession continues from the rest area along Street 1972, turn left onto Street 1007, turn left onto Street 598, continue to the Camko Si Thom roundabout, then turn left onto Angkor Boulevard, continue to turn right. Enter Win Victory Boulevard, then turn right onto National Road 5 towards Freedom Park to disperse.
In this campaign, there may be heavy traffic due to the means of transportation of the members who are invited to avoid traffic jams, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration will avoid traffic for all kinds of vehicles at the party meeting places and along the roads that the political parties are marching. Campaign march on July 20, 2023 from 06:00 until the end of the march.
