The volume of governance in Cambodia reached 1,133 million USD, an increase of more than 3,500%
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sok Dara, Director General of the Public Administration Regulation, said that up to now, the registered public administration volume in Cambodia has reached 1,133 million US dollars, an increase of more than 3,500%, which shows the rapid growth of The field of public administration in Cambodia.
