Mr. Khai Sinoeun stated that voting for the Cambodian People's Party is a party that has the confidence to lead the country, make the country peaceful, social stability, democracy, rule of law, development, prosperity, improve the working conditions and living standards of parents and siblings. It is better to have Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the candidate for the Prime Minister for the seventh term and to support Dr. Hun Manet as the candidate for the next Prime Minister.
