(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, on July 18, 2023, sent a message of condolences to Ms. Choeun Helen and her family on the death of Mr. Ouk Damri, Member of Parliament for Kandal Province.
