(Prey Veng): Mr. Keut Rith, Chairman of the Working Group of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Prey Sralith Commune, on Sunday, July 16, 2023, visited a meeting to teach how to draw ballots as well as campaign for the Cambodian People's Party for the election. The upcoming 7th legislature of 2023 to CPP members and people in 15 villages of Prey Sralith commune, Pearang district, Prey Veng province.
Mr. Keut Rith reminded that the Cambodian People's Party is a party that has made every effort to liberate Cambodia and save the lives of the Cambodian people from the flames of decades of war and also make Cambodia fully peaceful. As well as developing and stable as today.
On that occasion, Mr. Keut Rith called on all members and members of the Cambodian People's Party, as well as all citizens to prepare the relevant documents to participate in the election and to vote for the Cambodian People's Party. 18 on July 23, 2023.
At the same time, he also instructed the working group to facilitate all members and members of the Cambodian People's Party and all citizens, especially grandparents, the elderly and the disabled to make it easier to work. The process of participating in the election at each polling station for everyone.
He said that the Royal Government strives to build roads, bridges, interconnections from one area to another and build better quality is to make it easier for people to travel, giving them more options.
