Kralanh District Administration Requests Passers-by to Honor the National Flag Every Monday and Friday Morning
According to the announcement, in order to participate in maintaining and promoting the national identity and raising the awareness of the public, the Kralanh District Administration will organize the broadcast of the national anthem and the Nokor Reach song broadcast on the radio through the microphone (microphone) from the 24th of this month. July 2023, every Monday and Friday at 7:00 am from the front of the district hall to the intersection of the roundabout.
